# This plugin ships to POSIX and Windows alike, and one of its files is a shell
# script: `core.autocrlf=true` (common on Windows setups) would rewrite it to
# CRLF and break it under bash. Pin every text file to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF, without exception.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binaries, should any ever be added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
